Subject: I Miss Him!

>   While walking in the cemetery, Ray saw a man standing over a grave and
>crying
>hysterically, "Why did you die?  Why did you die?"  Being a Good Samaritan
>type,
>he decided to try to comvort th eman and walked over.  Observing the
>inscription
>on the tombstone, and seeing that it was another man's grave, he said, "I'm
>awfully sorry to see you so upset; this man must have been very close to you."
>   The man stopped crying for a minute and answered, "I never even saw him.
>It's my wife's first husband."

