Subject: Punkers!

>A punk, in full regalia (leather, chains, rings on every bodily protrusion,
>multicolored spiked hair . . . the works), happened to note an old man watching
>him intently from a park bench. The punk sauntered up to the oldster and,
>with a
>sneer curling his purple-colored lips, demanded to know what the old man was
>looking at.
>
>"You," replied the senior citizen.
>
>"Whatsamatter, don't you like what you see?" demanded the punk.
>
>Never taking his gaze from the punk, the old man said:  "About twenty years ago
>I had intercourse with a parrot.  I was just wondering if you might be my son."

regards,

