>This was an actual support call from some time ago. Someone  from OBU was the
>"Me" in the call...
>
>Me: "OK, Bob, let's press the control and escape keys at the same time.  That
>brings up a task list in the middle of the screen.  Now type the letter P to
>bring up the program manager."
>
>Bob:  "I don't have a P."
>
>Me: "On your keyboard, Bob."
>
>Bob: "What do you mean?"
>
>Me: "P on your keyboard, Bob."
>
>Bob:  "I'm not going to do that."

regards,

