Subject: Monuments to stupidity (fwd)
Message-ID: <Pine.LNX.3.91-heb-2.05.951219232122.1942B-100000@xpert.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; charset=US-ASCII
