>>A woman accompanied her husband to the doctor's office.  After the
>>check-up, the doctor took the wife aside and said, "If you don't do the
>>following, your husband will surely die."
>>
>>1.     "Each morning, fix him a healthy breakfast and
>>       send him off to work in a good mood."
>>
>>2.     "At lunch time, make him a warm, nutritious
>>       meal and put him in a good frame of mind before
>>       he goes back to work."
>>
>>3.     "For dinner, fix an especially nice meal and don't
>>       burden him with household chores."
>>
>>4.     "Have sex with him several times a week and
>>       satisfy his every whim."
>>
>>On the way home, the husband asked his wife what the doctor had said.
>>
>>She replied "You're going to die."




