* err typos are >not< under my responsibility. Sorry :(

Ok,

 So this guy enters a bar, carrying a brown paper bag with 
him, and a 
small suitcase. Sits next to the bartender, puts the paper 
bag on the 
desktop, and his suitcase on the floor, next to the stool.

 "Gimme a beer" asks the dude, so the bartender hands over 
a large foamy 
glass, and so he begins to drink. While the fellow drinks up to his 
pleasure, the bartender notices small, almost un-noticable movements 
within the paper bag. He gathers up some self confidence, and asks:

 "What do you have in that paper bag?"

 "Oh, its nothing. Something personal."

 Let the man have his privacy then. Several beers later, when they become 
more aquinted with each other, he asks him again. ( who knows its late 
already, and most of the usuals went home )

 "Whats that in that paper bag?"

 "Oh, its rather personal. Do you wish to see it?"

 "Yup... can you show it to me then?"

 "Ahem.. ok"

 So the dude puts his hand in the bag and pulls...

 1st, a small piano.
 
 2nd, a small stool...

 he puts the piano on the desktop, and the stool next to it.

 then he pulls a small man from the bag, and puts him on the stool. 
Suddenly, the man begins playing the piano...

 "THATS AMAZING" says the bartender... "But how'd ya get that little chum?"

 "Oh, you see" says the unsobre fellow, "I have this lamp in my suitcase, 
I rub it and this Genie pops out; And he does all your wishes..."

 "Yeah. and pigs can fly"

 "No *hickup* really... Here..."

 He kneels below and recovers a strange lamp from his suitcase. He puts 
it on the table.

 "Here, you try it."

 "What... oh, what the heck"

 So the bartender starts rubbing the lamp. Suddenly, a strange blueish 
gennie appears. *WHAM*

 "WHAT SHALL I DO FOR YOU MASTER?" asks the thing.

 "ahhemm.. I WANT A MILLION BUCKS" says the bartender...

 "LET IT BE." and poof. he's gone.

 a few minutes pass; nothing happens. The barman starts to think how 
crazy this fellow is, and suddenly...

 next to the ceiling...

 1 duck appears.
 and another.
 and another...
 4 ducks...
 5 ducks...

 "What the *#$%?" 

 9 ducks...
10 ducks...

 "You know, your genie is quite deaf" says the bartender to the person...

 "No Kidding? what did you think I asked for? a 12 inch pianist???"

*EOF*

 This was brought to you by 

 Yaron 



p.s.
 attention all lame joke providers. Take notes from this one. do NOT try 
to translate to hebrew tho';



