*** Yahel - there is a message for you at the end of this "joke" ***

hia all!

Some city people came to the village for a visit. While walking around 
they saw two horses.  One curious man comes to the farmer and asks:

" How are the horses? "
 
- " The white is great! " says the farmer.

" and the brown ? "  asks the man.

- " The brown is great too! ".

" do they race? " asks the man.

 - " the white does! " says the farmer.

" and the brown? "

- "the brown too."

" How much did they cost you?" asks the city man.

- " the white cost 200 $. "

"and the brown?" askes the curious man.

- " the brown 200 $" says the farmer.

"well,... why do you keep saying one thing about the white , and then 
when i ask about the brown you say the same?"

- " Ah, " says the farmer... " you should understand, the White horse 
belongs to me".

" oh, I see, and the brown?"

- "the brown too."




Yahel. I wanted to send this to some mailng list. I think you should open 
a special mailing list for me : 



 notfunny@xpert.com



 -shahar.



