>>     A couple, age 67, went to the doctor's office.  The doctor asked,
>>     "What can I do for you?"  The man said, "Will you watch us
>>have sex?" The doctor looked puzzled but agreed.  When the couple
>>finished, the doctor said, "There's nothing wrong with the way you
>>have sex", and he charged them $32.00.
>>
>>     This happened several weeks in a row.  The couple would make an
>>appointment, have sex, pay the doctor and leave.
>>Finally one day the doctor asked, "Just exactly what are you trying
>>to find out?"
>>     The old man said, "We're not trying to find out anything.  She's
>>married and we can't go to her house.  I'm married so we can't go to my
>>
>>house.
>>     The Holiday Inn charges $60.  The Hilton charges $78, so we do it
>>here
>>for $32 and I get back $28 from Medicare for a visit to the doctor's
>>office."



