>>Headline:  Energizer Bunny Dies
>>Los Angeles, California
>>
>>The Energizer Bunny passed away last evening.  From the autopsy report filed
>>this morning in Los Angeles, it appears that Mr. Bunny's cause of death was
>>cardiac arrest due to sexual overstimulation.  Apparently, someone put his
>>batteries in backwards, so he kept coming, and coming, and coming...



