>>Wife)  I have this shoebox that you can never look into, its a very
>>private box & I
>>must keep it that way!  But I will hide it so you are never tempted!
>>Husband) OK I can live w/ that.
>>So they got married and approx.  20 years later the husband was up in
>>the
>>attic cleaning when he finds this old shoebox hidden under some
>>blankets & all
>>taped up.  It dawns on him, that this must be the private shoebox his
>>wife had
>>told him about before they got married.  Well, curiousity gets the best
>>of him
>>& he opens it up.
>>Inside are 3 eggs & $20,000.00, this just really confuses him.  So he
>>decides
>>to confront his wife.
>>Husband) Honey, I was up in the attic cleaning & I came accross that
>>shoebox of yours
>>& well curiousity got the best of me & I opened it.  I can understand
>>the
>>$20,000. that's your money that's  fine, but what's up w/ those 3
>>eggs???
>>Wife)  well, darling, everytime we had REALLY bad sex I put an egg in
>>the box.
>>
>>-Well, he thinks about that for a min.
>>Hey, ya' know that's not bad at all!!!  3 eggs, 20 years!!  Feeling
>>pretty
>>studly he then asks her: Well how'd you get the 20 grand???
>>
>>Wife) Everytime I got a dozen, I sold them!!!

