>     One day, little Billy comes home from kindergarten for lunch.  Not
>     finding his mother in the kitchen or the living room, he heads
>     upstairs to check her bedroom.  He opens the door, and what does he
>     see, but his father, who had also come home for lunch, stripped naked,
