Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; charset=US-ASCII
Sender: owner-fun@fun
Precedence: bulk
Status: O
X-Status: 


In the days when Hillary Clinton was trying to reform the American health
care system she decided she needed a tour of a D.C. Hospital.

On the tour she came to a room on the male urology ward with the door closed.

She opened the door and screamed.

On the bed was a nurse giving the patient a hand job.

Mrs. Clinton's doctor tour guide reassured her that everything was O.K. and
that the patient had a disease of the testicles which required the
collection of a sperm sample twice per day to ensure that the medication
was working.

Hillary was not pleased but continued on the tour until she came to a
second door, also closed which she proceeded to open.

What she saw reduced her to hysterics.

Inside was a nurse giving the patient a blow job.

The doctor tour guide leaned over and wispered into Mrs. Clinton's ear;

"This man has the same disease of the testicles, but he has a better
medical plan."




