--- On Wed, 12 Jun 1996 07:44:17 +0300 (IDT)  Sharon Besser <sharon@ibm.net.il> wrote:



A man walked into a bar and ordered ten pints of Guinness, which he proceeded
to drink, one after the other, draining each one straight down.  The barman
said to him, "Steady on - what's happened to you?"  The man replied that he
had just experienced his first blow job.

Knowing what a momentous occasion that was for a guy, the barman offered to
buy him another drink to celebrate.

"No thanks," said the man.  "If those ten don't get rid of the taste, another
one's not going to help".




