>>> > The Nuns at the Pearly Gates
>>> >
>>> >
>>> > So these four nuns die and go to heaven, and stand in line before the
>>> > pearly gates.  Saint Peter is there, guarding the entrance to heaven,
>>> > and he says, "Sisters, I must ask each of you one question before
>>> > you may pass on into Paradise," so he says to the first nun,
>>> > "Have you ever touched a man's penis?"
>>> >
>>> > The nun frowns in guilt and admits, "Yes, Saint Peter, I did, once,
>>> > but it was only for a second, with the tip of my finger."
>>> > Saint Peter replies, "Sister Margaret, all is forgiven, just dip your
>>> > finger in the holy water and you may pass."
>>> >
>>> >  So he says to the second nun, "Sister, have you ever touched a
>>> > man's penis?" and she replies, blushing ever so slightly, "Why yes,
>>> > Saint > Peter, I am afraid I did, but it was only for a minute, with my
>>> > hand."
>>> > Saint Peter answers, "Sister, your sins are forgiven, just dip
>>> > your hand in the holy water and move on."
>>> >
>>> > Meanwhile, Saint Peter notices the third and fourth nun
>>> > switching places in line.  He says to the fourth nun, who was now the
>>> > third, "Sister Anne, I am going to ask you the same question I asked
>>> > the other two nuns, but first I would like to know: Why did you switch
>>> > places with Sister Mary?"
>>> >
>>> >  Sister Anne replies, "Well, Saint Peter, if you thought I was
>>> > going to gargle with the holy water after she sits in it, you're out
>>> > of your mind!"




