   Submitted by Clasl@aol.com | Author: Unknown
   
   The Earth was totally destroyed by the nucelar warfare, and there were
   two survivors left. The two survivors were a Deaf man and a Hearing
   man. Both met in the middle of the destruction and they were trying to
   communicate. All the sudden, there was a light form the sky coming
   closer and there is a God. These men were amazed and looked at each
   other to make sure if the image of God is actually real.
   
   God spoke, "Congratulations! You are the only first person to task for
   three wishes and these wishes will be granted to the first person,
   however the second person will get this same wish doubled." A hearing
   man thought about it, then he said to the Deaf man, "Well, I think
   that with your unfortunate disability you have, I will let you to be
   the first person to ask for three wishes," The Deaf was bit surprised
   and elated, then he pondered what are the things he could wish for...
   
   He signed, "God, I wish I could have four huge houses." God gave four
   houses to Deaf man and then he also gave eight houses to hearing man.
   The Deaf man saw that and he was not that too thrilled about it. Then
   he thought of the second wish, "God, I want 200 Deaf women, please."
   God, of course, gave him 200 Deaf women and then another 400 Defa
   women for the hearing guy. Then the Deaf man spent time thinking...
   and finally he has an idea. He signed, "God, I would like for you to
   take one of my testicles, please." God took one away, and...God also
   took two from a hearing gy....So, the Deaf man said....."Yeah! Now, I
   will have a Deaf World!"
   

