Did it ever happen to you that you wanted to call someone names but
got stuck because all conventional derogatory labels have already
been used, or because you wanted to prove your originality by using
some unusual and rarely used label?

If yes, the following list (courtesy of Malka Susswein and Zvi Altman)
would prove to be godsend for you.
                                          --- Omer

You're dumber than a drowning hipopatomous!

and you are as stubborn as a donkey!
 
and you are as small as a virus!

and you are more ugly than a cockroach!

and you are more formless than a jellyfish!

and you are more senile than a snail!

and U R more treacherous than an hungry hyena!

and U R more deranged then a charging rhino.

and you're more annoying than a mosquito!

and you are slickier than an aplyxia.

and you're dumber then a brain dead ant!

and you are crazier than a gorilla!

you're nuttier than an almond!

You're nuttier than a nut!

                  ----====*====----

