Subject: Banks... Banks...
Message-ID: <Pine.GSO.3.93-heb-2.06.960820132254.7448A-100000@sun100.cs.hai.iec.co.il>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; charset=US-ASCII
