>>A woman has been married to her husband for ten years, and for all
>>those ten years her husband insisted on making love in the dark.  No
>>matter how much she asked him, he would never turn the lights on.
>>
>>One night she grew tired of this and turned on the light while they
>>were having sex and saw that he was using a dildo on her.
>>
>>She says, "Honey, how could you do this! All this time you've never
>>told me. Explain yourself immediately!!"
>>
>>The husband says "OK, I'll explain, but first you have to explain the kids."


