>    * Beeping me more than once while I'm asleep - $50 per beep
>    * Beeping me and not identifying yourself within the first 5
>      seconds - $25
>    * Beeping me and then changing your story / denying you placed the
>      call / hoped I would forget who caused the problem - $500
> 
> Special Rates:
> 
>    * Dealing with user body odor - $75.00/hour
>    * Dealing with user not familiar with the primary language spoken
