>>Bill Clinton's aids come up to him and tell him that he needs to pay more
>>attention to the abortion bill. He ignores them, so they pester him for the
>>next week about dealing with the abortion bill. Finally he tells them, 'Just
>>pay the damn thing.'
>>
>>
>>
>>How Republicans Arrive at Conclusions:
>>This group of Republicans are trying to teach a cockroach how to jump.
>>They pull off a leg and say 'jump' and the cockroach leaps.
>>They pull off another leg and say 'jump' and the cockroach leaps again.
>>They continue this until the cockroach has no legs. They say 'jump' and the
>>cockroach just lays there.
>>The conclusion they reach is that when you pull all the legs off of a
>>cockroach, he goes deaf.



